Saucedemo checklist:
1. Add product to cart test
2. Successful product purchase
3. Price filter from low to high works correctly
4. Product can be removed from cart
5. Button "Continue shopping" navigates to products page


Урок 22 Maven
1. Обновить версии всех библиотек в проекте:
 mvn versions:use-latest-versions

PS C:\Users\alina.stashuk\IdeaProjects\Saucedemo> mvn versions:use-latest-versions
